  "bio": "Gabriel Gimenes stands out in Londrina, Brazil, as a tattoo artist with an impeccable reputation for cleanliness. Specializing in neotraditional tattoos, Gabriel's workspace reflects a commitment to hygiene and safety, ensuring that each client's experience is not only aesthetically pleasing but also held to the highest sanitary standards. Whether you're seeking bold lines or intricate shades of black and gray, Gabriel's studio is a beacon of cleanliness in the world of tattoo artistry.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Londrina, Parana, Brazil\n\n• PRETO E CINZA •     \n• PRESIDENTE PRUDENTE/SP - BR •                                        • Neotrad: @ggimenes.nt •\n⬇️ Agendamentos pelo link:",
